        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "It's mainly for 'neovide' and maybe for other plugins that provide visual feedback when cursor jumps. In 'neovide' there's a visual effect for when cursor jumps and it can be distracting in this particular case because cursor jumps in cmdline only to be 'hidden'.  That's why I think it would be better if 'mini.pick' truly hid cursor.",
